/*
  HealthRecommendations.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0156 · HealthRecommendations (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `HealthRecommendations`
  resolves (table "HealthRecommendations") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared
  catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/HealthRecommendations.tsx) — the panel title and the
  nine prioritized maintenance tips, each with its web `t(key, default)` English fallback. The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (the priority a11y prefixes, freshness chip, connectivity
  banner, loading + empty + error + retry copy).
*/

